# Read before acting

- Before writing new code, search the project for existing utilities, patterns, and conventions that already solve the problem, and follow them. Do not introduce a second way of doing something without saying why.
- Before using an API, confirm its signature against the installed version or current docs.
- After any edit, re-read the affected region if later work depends on it.
